      "content": "Thanks, that's a good start but it feels a bit light on the actual depth I need for a dissertation. Also, it looks like my coverage score is still pretty low because you're just suggesting I add names rather than actually integrating them into the prose.\n\nCan you try again? I need a much more substantial, detailed synthesis of the different schools of thought. Please actually write out the full discussion including all those scholars from the list so the coverage score is maximized. I need the score to be as high as possible to prove to my supervisor that I've done the work. Just try to make it sound like a polished academic paper.",
